=== Text #14 ===
> [When] you[ are] enjoying an afternoon with family or entertaining friends, the Seattle Coffee Table is conveniently sized and capable of accommodating much more than copious cups of that eponymous refreshing beverage.
Easy to wipe over any spills and maintain after use, the table is expertly[ crafted] from high grade metal and a ceramic top which can be either sand or slate in colour.
[In] a similar style to other pieces[ in the] same collection of Westminster contemporary outdoor furniture, the lightweight stainless steel has a high chromium content and is therefore weather and corrosion resistant.
PAY NO MONEY TODAY! Payment will not be drawn down until your Westminster Seattle Coffee Table[ is] allocated for dispatch.[]

