=== Text #19 ===
> [If] you have need for a hostess for your upcoming event click here for more info as part of the package we off free promotion of your event before, during and after on our website and our social media accounts.
Our grid girl Lara was at Oulton Park British GT on Bank Holiday Monday 22nd April 2019 working with Orbital Food Machinery sponsored JRM Racing Bentley.
Our ring girl Jess[ was working] the Muay Thai Promotions ‘Shins of Steele 5’show at Kings Hall, Stoke on Trent on Saturday 20th April 2019.[][]

